config KEXEC_MOD
	tristate "Kexec Module"
	default m
	help
	  This module allows kexec functionality to be loaded as a module.
	  It is useful for systems where kexec support is needed but
	  cannot be built into the kernel core or when a kernel reinstall
	  is not possible.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the
	  module will be called kexec_mod.
